    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 199,000\n\nThe Ash, in the Clonard Village development, is tucked away and No. 4 stands in a block of apartments with easy access to the retail parks, local shops and the Whitford House Hotel. \nThis first floor apartment offers 2 bedrooms, main bedroom with en-suite, family bathroom and large bright open plan kitchen/living area. There is lots of natural light in this area with windows on two sides and this is added to by French doors to access the wrap around balcony area.\nA local bus route serves the area and there is easy access to the N25 and N11 at the Whitford roundabout.\nA perfect bolt-hole, investment property, downsizer, or first home in a great location. The property is being sold with contents (bar personal items) so it is ready to go.\nBuilt 2004, management fee 1200 per annum, 64 sqm."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Corridor - 5.4m x 1.1m\nwith laminate flooring\n\nLiving/Kitchen Area - \n\n\nKitchen - 3.2m x 2.1m\nwith tiled floor and waist and eye level units\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 6m x 4.2m\ndouble aspect room with laminate flooring, electric fire in marble and timber surround. French doors to wrap around balcony - 2.3m x 0.9m and 2m x 0.9m\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5m x 3.3m\ncarpet and double wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 1.7m\nwith tiled floor and bath surround, WC, WHB and bath\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 2.8m\nwith laminate flooring and double wardrobe\n\nEn-Suite - 2.4m x 1m\nwith tiled floor and shower surround, WC, WHB and mains shower\n\n"
      },
